            "review_title": "Review at moggumeong Danang",
            "review_text": "Sally Lindsay\nMassachusetts2 contributions\n0\nOrdered Pork Belly\nApr 2026 • Solo\nWent during non-peak time, so the wait wasn’t bad. Just a heads-up: there’s an 8% tax, so the final bill came to 237k. They also accept international Visa debit cards, which was convenient.\n\nAs for the food, I’d rate it 4/5. The pork was decent overall, but the quality felt a bit inconsistent. Service was okay, though the overall experience didn’t fully live up to the hype. Still, going at a quieter time definitely made the meal more comfortable.\nWritten April 20, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
