            "review_title": "Review at moggumeong Danang",
            "review_text": "LOTRing\nSingapore453 contributions\n0\nGreat Korean bbq\nOct 2024 • Friends\nIt's interesting to find high-quality Korean bbq in Vietnam. The menu is simple. We only need to choose from 4 types of meat, and they took care of the rest. Service was prompt, and ambience was cosy. The boss is Korean, and he seems to be supervising all processes. Seems like 80% of customers are Koreans, so it's very authentic. We enjoyed the meal.\nWritten October 30, 2024",
